Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.25,0:00:05.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,The next one is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.71,0:00:07.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wind Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.75,0:00:16.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:25.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,The more time that I manage to buy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.42,0:00:27.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,the better chance Lynne and\Nthe others have to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.79,0:00:31.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm just gonna run around and\Nparry everything in front of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.08,0:00:40.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I finally stopped myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.54,0:00:46.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.79,0:00:48.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who's this old guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.75,0:02:25.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sparkly gold armor and sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.33,0:02:27.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even the horse has\Nsparkly gold riding gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.33,0:02:31.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why is he standing around here\Nin such a noticeable outfit?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.79,0:02:34.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,He just looks like\Nan old-timer to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.13,0:02:39.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.63,0:02:42.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now's not the time\Nto think about these random things!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.67,0:02:50.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I won't stand a chance if these soldiers\Ngather their weapons
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.54,0:02:52.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,and attack all at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.29,0:02:55.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,All their swords and shields...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.75,0:02:57.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have to do my best\Nto keep parrying them!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.17,0:03:01.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not sure what that is,\Nbut I gotta get it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.46,0:03:18.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I really wonder what this old guy\Nis doing out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.63,0:03:20.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,That bastard again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.17,0:03:21.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.21,0:03:24.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't stand here and give the soldiers\Ntime to pick up their weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.00,0:03:38.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I gotta remember to breathe\Nevery once in a while or I'll pass out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.83,0:03:41.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hold on, haven't I seen you before?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.58,0:03:44.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,H-he's gonna kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.96,0:03:47.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,This sparkly gold old man...\NDoes he know me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.38,0:03:51.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nah, I don't think we've met before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.33,0:03:54.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,But jeez, it's crazy he's out\Non this battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.33,0:03:59.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't really see any need\Nto parry his sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.96,0:04:02.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,No time to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.29,0:04:04.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I just need to keep doing my part!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.54,0:04:34.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure that sparkly gold old man\Nis going to get hurt if he stays there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.54,0:04:39.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wh-who the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.25,0:04:41.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why haven't you just killed me yet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.13,0:04:43.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.50,0:04:46.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Does he think I came here\Nto take his life?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.42,0:04:49.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't blame him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.25,0:04:53.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Th-that weapon...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.33,0:04:55.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don- don't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.96,0:04:58.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.50,0:05:02.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I need something to reassure him.\NTo let him know I'm not hostile.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.17,0:05:07.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is this working...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.58,0:05:14.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.88,0:05:16.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure he got the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.54,0:05:26.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Am I at my limit?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.92,0:05:30.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thinking about it,\NI was a bit too reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.42,0:05:34.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,And Low Heal can't do anything\Nto relieve exhaustion this bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.04,0:05:40.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lynne...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.83,0:05:42.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ines...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.58,0:05:43.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Rolo...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.29,0:05:46.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,please escape safely...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.38,0:05:49.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Shooting Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.08,0:06:00.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,That skill...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.04,0:06:08.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dragrave!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.00,0:06:22.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did you come for me,\NGilbird... Alma...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.29,0:06:25.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Grillbeer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.54,0:06:26.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's Gilbert.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.54,0:06:32.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,You did all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.58,0:06:37.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nice of you to\Nfinally join us, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.04,0:06:39.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.33,0:06:41.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.17,0:06:48.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are,\Nbut thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.04,0:06:50.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll take care of the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.04,0:06:56.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,We at least have to handle the cleanup,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.50,0:06:59.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,or it would stain the honor of the\NSixth Troop of the Royal Capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.29,0:07:07.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thousand Blades!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.21,0:07:13.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I remember. That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.75,0:07:19.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's the power of the swordsman\Nwho I've always dreamed of being!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.67,0:07:22.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.25,0:07:27.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,And after I warned him\Nagainst any excessive killing...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.42,0:07:28.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.75,0:07:34.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd say that's a tall order to make\Nwhen we're faced with such a vast army!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:37.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, corpses won't provide us any intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.46,0:07:40.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,The living are far more cooperative.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.42,0:07:42.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Since it's easy to\Nbring back missing limbs
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.25,0:07:44.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,over and over\Nwith healing magic and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.29,0:07:47.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,That was a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.63,0:07:51.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Doesn't quite sound like a joke\Nwhen you say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.46,0:07:52.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oken.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.67,0:07:55.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,They should be arriving soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:07:56.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.21,0:07:58.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't have to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.04,0:08:01.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,We've been strung along\Nby the enemy long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.83,0:08:04.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now it's my time to shine!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.29,0:08:11.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Earth Bind!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.54,0:08:12.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.58,0:08:14.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't move! What the...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.71,0:08:25.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.96,0:08:27.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Their eyes are red as fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.79,0:08:29.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,You seem like you're enjoying this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.96,0:08:31.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Heh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.17,0:08:35.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,A good battle is always riveting,\Nno matter how old I get!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.25,0:08:38.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now, shall we add the final touches?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.75,0:08:43.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stone Prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.21,0:08:55.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's our turn now. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.13,0:09:02.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Time to save all the survivors\Nand make them turn over a new leaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.92,0:09:09.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,The instructors that taught me\Nat the training schools...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.33,0:09:18.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I get to see them again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.42,0:09:26.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,That kid. That has to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.67,0:09:29.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.42,0:09:39.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Lynne.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.08,0:09:41.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling much better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.50,0:09:44.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.17,0:09:45.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you rest a bit longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.54,0:09:50.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nah, I've rested enough.\NI can move again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.96,0:09:53.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm really hungry, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.71,0:09:57.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,A commanding officer confessed\Nunder Sain's interrogation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.04,0:09:58.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,They have no further troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.75,0:10:01.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,They already threw\Neverything they had at us,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.67,0:10:04.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,including the dragon and beasts\Nthat attacked the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.00,0:10:07.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,But it seems the emperor\Nhas escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.38,0:10:08.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,The emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.67,0:10:12.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,That decrepit old fogey\Nshowed up on the battlefield?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.17,0:10:13.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.13,0:10:15.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,He must have been very confident\Nin his resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.21,0:10:17.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.71,0:10:21.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stupid move for a guy who demands\Nhis people call him a wise ruler!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.46,0:10:24.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,That geezer must be losing his marbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.33,0:10:27.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Geezer? You mean that old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.92,0:10:29.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.04,0:10:31.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,You know who we're talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.46,0:10:33.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I met him a little while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.04,0:10:39.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,The horse he was riding had sparkly\Ngold gear and he was hard to miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.04,0:10:41.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Gold on his horse, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.29,0:10:44.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Perhaps he was\Nusing orichalcum saddlery.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.08,0:10:49.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's very high-grade equipment that\Ncan support an extensive array of skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.92,0:10:54.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,In which case, it makes sense\Nhow he escaped so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.17,0:10:56.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,But jeez, he was all decked out in gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.79,0:10:59.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,His fashion sense is as poor\Nas his attitude!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.92,0:11:03.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,If he escapes to the border,\Nwe can't go after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.71,0:11:07.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's a fortress as well as a bridge\Nthat spans the ravine over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.38,0:11:11.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no hope of catching up to him\Nby now with normal means.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.33,0:11:15.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,If only there was a way\Nfor us to all fly...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:16.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.75,0:11:19.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think that might be possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.54,0:11:21.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.92,0:11:27.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, only assuming\Nthat it's still alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.29,0:11:33.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,What an incredible sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.50,0:11:37.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Being able to see a legendary\Ncreature up close and personal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.29,0:11:39.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,This makes living\Nto my old age worth it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.29,0:11:41.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.83,0:11:45.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is the first time I've been tasked\Nwith healing such an enormous dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.67,0:12:02.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,In any case,\Nyou've grown quite a lot, Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.83,0:12:04.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I almost didn't recognize you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.54,0:12:05.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.04,0:12:09.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,This man... is Noor, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.08,0:12:12.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes. I could tell right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.58,0:12:16.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's been a long time\Nsince I've seen you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.04,0:12:17.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.46,0:12:20.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I had no idea it was you at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.25,0:12:22.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're much larger than you used to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.83,0:12:25.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor, you're still\Nalive and well, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.54,0:12:26.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh ho?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.88,0:12:29.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's a mean thing to say to my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.71,0:12:33.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I plan to live another\Nhundred years, easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.92,0:12:37.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,And your jokes are still funny\Nafter all these years!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.08,0:12:39.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, I'm not joking though...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.92,0:12:42.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, listen, Noor...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.38,0:12:45.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:49.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Having us all ride on the back\Nof this dragon seems like a bad idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.96,0:12:52.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.92,0:12:54.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,We've got Rolo with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.21,0:12:58.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.71,0:13:02.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Rolo, my boy, are you confident\Nin this ability of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.58,0:13:07.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,N-no, I have no confidence at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.63,0:13:09.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh ho?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.63,0:13:11.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Instructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.46,0:13:13.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,It may not look it, but Rolo is-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.50,0:13:18.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It seems the dragon is coming to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.67,0:13:23.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are we truly going to be okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.46,0:13:26.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Rolo, you've got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.21,0:13:28.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.79,0:13:42.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see. It's angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.25,0:13:44.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can understand it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.54,0:13:46.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Only enough to tell its mood\Nfrom how it sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.71,0:13:48.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've lived in the mountains\Nfor a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.54,0:13:53.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,It seems to want revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.08,0:13:55.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It wants you to order it to get some.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.88,0:13:57.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wh-what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.42,0:14:00.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You have that much control\Nover this dragon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.63,0:14:03.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Extraordinary!\NAbsolutely extraordinary!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.88,0:14:06.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Rolo is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.25,0:14:08.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, that isn't true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.58,0:14:10.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,This dragon thinks Noor is-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.33,0:14:16.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,It says it wants to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.83,0:14:18.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:19.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone catching a ride, get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.67,0:14:20.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.58,0:14:26.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lynne and Ines, you're coming too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.79,0:14:27.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.67,0:14:32.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,No one can talk to the dragon\Nif Rolo doesn't go,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.00,0:14:35.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,so Ines and I will guard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.38,0:14:37.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,You'll be joining us too,\Nright, Instructor?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.92,0:14:38.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.21,0:14:43.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well... I guess I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.96,0:14:49.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid of heights, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.29,0:14:53.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I'm the one who came up with the idea\Nand dragged Rolo into this,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.79,0:14:57.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,so it'd be really awkward\Nif I don't tag along.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.13,0:15:01.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, but still... I mean, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.46,0:15:04.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.00,0:15:07.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm... going too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.71,0:15:09.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.21,0:15:11.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,You being with us is like having\Nthe strength of a hundred people!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.96,0:15:13.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm coming as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.54,0:15:17.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have a responsibility to look after\Nmy patient until it's fully recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.75,0:15:21.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Plus, we specialize in diplomacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.00,0:15:22.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right, Carew?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.96,0:15:24.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't lump me in with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.92,0:15:28.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't try and intimidate people\Nwith mischief.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.29,0:15:30.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.42,0:15:35.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,the thief class instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.17,0:15:36.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're coming with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.54,0:15:40.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, if you're going to fly\Non this large of a beast,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.21,0:15:42.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,then you will need\Nthe Concealment skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.42,0:15:44.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll be in charge of that part.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.88,0:15:46.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good point!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.42,0:15:48.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll come along to help, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.25,0:15:52.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oken, you need to supervise\Nthe stone cage, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.67,0:15:54.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.88,0:15:56.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let me go as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.79,0:15:59.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You'll need a negotiator, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.83,0:16:02.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Brother! Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.46,0:16:03.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.88,0:16:07.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Guess you've been worried about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.54,0:16:09.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see you're safe as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.42,0:16:13.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,You chose to come back\Ninstead of going to Mithra, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.96,0:16:14.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.75,0:16:17.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I will accept any punishment\Nfor disobeying your order.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.25,0:16:20.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.25,0:16:23.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's my fault for giving\Nsuch an idiotic order.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.25,0:16:27.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you made it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.54,0:16:35.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Rein, you're in charge of making\Nany judgment calls out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.79,0:16:38.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,And also... Sir Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.83,0:16:42.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I apologize for continuously\Nasking for your help,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.21,0:16:44.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,but please take care of these two.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.54,0:16:46.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.67,0:16:48.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.04,0:16:49.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll come back safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.46,0:16:52.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.96,0:17:00.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.75,0:17:12.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're okay with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.46,0:17:16.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, shouldn't you have\Nsaid something to Noor?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.04,0:17:20.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,We finally found him after all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.38,0:17:26.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,The fact of the matter is, he never really\Nneeded us to play a role in his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.29,0:17:30.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,The idea that we could take him in\Nand raise him...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.54,0:17:32.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,we were just high on our own hubris.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.08,0:17:34.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.58,0:17:38.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,He was like a hero\Nstraight out of the legends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.00,0:17:40.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Makes me feel like a laughingstock.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.83,0:17:41.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right now, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.88,0:17:51.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am deeply ashamed\Nof my own laziness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.17,0:17:55.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have been wasting time
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.25,0:17:57.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,thinking I was in any position\Nto teach others.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.04,0:18:00.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm going to retrain myself\Nfrom scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.08,0:18:04.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now that I've been made aware\Nof my own shortcomings,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.38,0:18:07.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't rest on my laurels\Nand let my sword rust.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.96,0:18:12.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,For a guy who's "deeply ashamed,"\Nyou seem pretty darn happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.38,0:18:13.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.83,0:18:16.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just think of the\Nspectacle he showed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.42,0:18:18.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.50,0:18:20.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,After being shown something like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.42,0:18:22.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,who wouldn't be?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.17,0:18:35.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Have you found anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.67,0:18:36.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.79,0:18:39.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Any luck over there, Lady Lynneburg?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.00,0:18:42.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.54,0:18:53.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's much faster than I imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.92,0:18:58.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Worst case scenario, he may have\Nalready arrived back at the empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.13,0:19:05.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,It turns into empire-controlled territory\Nbeyond that steel bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.71,0:19:08.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,We can't recklessly rush in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.13,0:19:12.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know we've come this far,\Nbut perhaps we should consider going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.63,0:19:13.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.29,0:19:15.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let me think...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.96,0:19:18.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.04,0:19:19.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Something's moving at\Nan extremely high speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.33,0:19:27.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's definitely him. However...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.71,0:19:29.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's nearing the\Nimperial capital's defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.88,0:19:33.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,We won't make it back in one piece\Nif we cross into their territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:36.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,We are concealed right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.21,0:19:41.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,but once they're aware of our existence,\Nthe magic will lose its effectiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.50,0:19:44.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,True, but letting him escape\Nis not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.17,0:19:47.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,They have access to\Npowerful magical tools
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.71,0:19:50.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,and can use them to greatly\Nreinforce their military power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.58,0:19:53.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,We cannot give them the time\Nto do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.38,0:19:58.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.04,0:20:00.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're already at war.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.46,0:20:04.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,But... who knows what awaits us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.04,0:20:07.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lord Rein, Lady Lynneburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.92,0:20:12.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I may, I would like your permission\Nto annihilate this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.67,0:20:13.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Annihilate?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.50,0:20:17.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,If this is going to be\Nour escape route later,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.08,0:20:20.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,then it would be smart to annihilate their\Ndefenses while we have the opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.96,0:20:26.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,In normal situations, Ines would never\Nsuggest exerting her own power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.58,0:20:29.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, she's angry just like the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.63,0:20:33.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,The royal capital she vowed to\Nrisk her life to protect was trampled on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.75,0:20:34.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.75,0:20:37.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do it, Ines. And don't hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.96,0:20:39.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.67,0:20:45.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Divine Sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.50,0:21:04.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.88,0:21:10.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think that secures our escape route.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.21,0:21:12.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right. Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.33,0:21:14.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lynne!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.13,0:21:18.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our actions here will determine\Nthe course of the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.29,0:21:20.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll keep pursuing the emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.63,0:21:22.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,and go all the way to\Nthe imperial capital, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.00,0:21:24.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you ready for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.92,0:21:25.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.00,0:21:31.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone here wields power\Nfar outside the norm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.96,0:21:34.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're the strongest people imaginable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.38,0:21:38.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no need\Nto worry about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.17,0:21:41.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,And above them all...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.71,0:21:42.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.75,0:21:46.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't even begin to\Ncomprehend his greatness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.54,0:21:49.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's quietly listening\Nto all this, even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.13,0:21:51.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,And he knows we mean business!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.29,0:21:56.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's teach them a hard lesson\Nabout what happens
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.83,0:21:58.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,when you mess with\Nthe wrong people!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.04,0:22:11.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,#10 I Parry the Emperor's Authority
